{
  "id": "boiler___efficiency",
  "title": "Boiler - Efficiency",
  "description": "Calculate boiler efficiency based on heat exported by the fluid relative to heat provided by the fuel. Supports both water heating and steam boiler calculations.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Boiler Efficiency Calculator\n\nBoiler efficiency can be indicated by:\n- **Combustion Efficiency** - burner's ability to burn fuel\n- **Thermal Efficiency** - heat exchanger's effectiveness to transfer heat\n- **Fuel to Fluid Efficiency** - overall efficiency including losses\n\n### Formula\nBoiler efficiency (%) = 100 × (Heat exported by fluid / Heat provided by fuel)\n\n### Heat Exported from the Boiler\n\nFor water heating:\n- **q = (m/t) × cp × ΔT**\n\nFor steam boilers:\n- **q = (m/t) × h_e**\n\n### Heat Provided by Fuel\nUse either Gross or Net Calorific Value. Net calorific value ≈ Gross calorific value - 10%"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "massFlow",
          "label": "Mass Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/s",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "specificHeat",
          "label": "Specific Heat (for water heating)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg°C",
          "defaultValue": 4.18
        },
        {
          "id": "tempDifference",
          "label": "Temperature Difference (ΔT)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "°C",
          "defaultValue": 30
        },
        {
          "id": "evaporationEnergy",
          "label": "Evaporation Energy (for steam, optional)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kJ/kg",
          "defaultValue": 2257
        },
        {
          "id": "boilerType",
          "label": "Boiler Type",
          "type": "select",
          "defaultValue": "water",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Water Heating",
              "value": "water"
            },
            {
              "label": "Steam Boiler",
              "value": "steam"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "heatExported",
          "label": "Heat Exported by Fluid",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 125.4
        },
        {
          "id": "fuelEnergy",
          "label": "Heat Provided by Fuel",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kW",
          "defaultValue": 150
        },
        {
          "id": "calorificValue",
          "label": "Calorific Value Type",
          "type": "select",
          "defaultValue": "gross",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Gross Calorific Value",
              "value": "gross"
            },
            {
              "label": "Net Calorific Value",
              "value": "net"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "heatExportedCalc",
          "label": "Heat Exported by Fluid",
          "formula": "inputs.boilerType === 'water' ? inputs.massFlow * inputs.specificHeat * inputs.tempDifference : inputs.massFlow * inputs.evaporationEnergy",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "boilerEfficiency",
          "label": "Boiler Efficiency",
          "formula": "(inputs.heatExported / inputs.fuelEnergy) * 100",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "netCalorificAdjustment",
          "label": "Net Calorific Value Adjustment",
          "formula": "inputs.calorificValue === 'net' ? inputs.fuelEnergy * 0.9 : inputs.fuelEnergy",
          "unit": "kW",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "adjustedEfficiency",
          "label": "Adjusted Efficiency (with calorific type)",
          "formula": "(inputs.heatExported / (inputs.calorificValue === 'net' ? inputs.fuelEnergy * 0.9 : inputs.fuelEnergy)) * 100",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Fuel",
        "Unit",
        "Energy (Btu)"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "No. 1 Oil",
          "Gallon",
          137400
        ],
        [
          "No. 2 Oil",
          "Gallon",
          139600
        ],
        [
          "No. 3 Oil",
          "Gallon",
          141800
        ],
        [
          "No. 4 Oil",
          "Gallon",
          145100
        ],
        [
          "No. 5 Oil",
          "Gallon",
          148800
        ],
        [
          "No. 6 Oil",
          "Gallon",
          152400
        ],
        [
          "Natural Gas",
          "cu. ft.",
          "950 - 1050"
        ],
        [
          "Propane",
          "cu. ft.",
          2550
        ],
        [
          "Butane",
          "cu. ft.",
          3200
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}